{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"真洋お誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/24/7686152/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先に18歳になられたわー\n元気いっぱいの真洋だいすき♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/24/7686152/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、初期の頃！懐かしい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日一人で風立ちぬを観てきました。\nみなさんはもう観ましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一回ちゃんと見たい！\nジブリの音楽って本当に素敵だなあ。\nジブリ曲はハウルの動く城の\n人生のメリーゴーランドがすきで、\n前に研修旅行で北海道行ったとき\nこの曲のオルゴール買ったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、千と千尋の神隠しの\nSpirited Awayもすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いたら「ああ〜」ってなるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/24/7686152/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの好きなジブリ曲は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/24/7686152/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めざましライブ、個握...\n今週はイベント盛りだくさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/24/7686152/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハ頑張る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！今日のお昼に\nそうめん食べました！\n茄子、トマト、納豆、ツナと一緒に。\nうまかった！\n夏は暑いけど\n夏野菜いっぱい食べられて幸せ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/24/7686152/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あああ、ああ、やばい\nお腹が空いてきた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}